430 files under app/.cxx were committed by the initial import. They are
generated by every gradle build â€” three of them were rewritten by the Phase 1
compile and rode along in that commit, which would repeat on every build and
bury real changes in noise.

Removed from the index only; the files stay on disk and are regenerated as
normal. Adds .cxx/ to .gitignore.
